WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,710
Don't hide it from the young master

2
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:01,840
The team the young master is going to this time

3
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,640
It's a convoy organized by a big shot from my Tie family.

4
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,520
If you want to join, you must have an identity.

5
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,440
If the young master is not good at martial arts,

6
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,840
I will arrange for the young master to be a groom or other ordinary person. If the young master has martial arts,

7
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,560
Then the escort can be arranged as an escort compared to the groom

8
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,760
The guards will be treated better along the way.

9
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,480
There are not many unsightly Lake Aramuru in Omae.

10
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,880
Dare to be the team of my Tie family?

11
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,620
Then arrange for me to be your escort, okay?

12
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,210
Spectacular

13
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,840
That is our Tie family’s fleet

14
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,960
How can we have such a big organization?

15
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:46,010
Most families simply can't do it like a boy.

16
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:47,290
Then wait for the team to set off

17
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:49,650
Just follow me next

18
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:52,490
Young Master, just follow the convoy and arrive at the Imperial Capital.

19
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:53,850
Just leave the convoy directly

20
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:55,790
Sorry, the shopkeeper.

21
00:00:57,510 --> 00:00:58,830
Sir, you don’t have to be like this

22
00:00:58,830 --> 00:00:59,870
It's all a matter of favor
